{"id": "air-district-contractor-rate-reconciliation", "title": "Eight staffing charges exceeded the terms of a Bay Area air monitoring contract", "seconds": 53.6, "voice": "elevenlabs:iPYqcpY8j8Ap4jUf28I3", "narrator": "Michael", "tempo": 1.065, "made": "2026-11-26", "key": "e6024e6ef2459a93", "words": 136, "beats": [{"scene": "rates", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "An Air District audit matched invoices with the contract’s list of hourly rates.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.63, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Which", "rate", "did", "the", "contract", "authorize?"], "sub": "Air District invoice review"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.45, 0.86, 1.17, 1.61, 2.19, 2.35, 2.46, 3.06, 3.37, 3.49, 3.94]}, {"scene": "rates", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The auditors questioned 3,486 dollars for two labor positions outside the contract.", "t0": 4.75, "t1": 11.61, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "Contract 2023.122", "heading": "Two categories of questioned fees", "source": "audit24", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "Two unlisted labor positions", "value": "$3,486"}, {"icon": "contract", "label": "Six rates above the agreement", "value": "$5,830"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.69, 1.24, 1.69, 2.27, 2.58, 3.0, 3.66, 4.48, 4.66, 4.97, 5.29, 5.8, 6.17, 6.27]}, {"scene": "rates", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "They also identified 5,830 dollars charged above the rates the contract specified.", "t0": 11.73, "t1": 18.19, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$5,830", "label": "Charges above agreed hourly rates"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.57, 1.22, 1.62, 2.17, 2.43, 2.78, 3.13, 4.01, 4.5, 4.73, 4.86, 5.16, 5.28, 5.76]}, {"scene": "rates", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Together, the questioned fees totaled 9,316 dollars.", "t0": 18.31, "t1": 23.21, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "$9,316 in questioned fees"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.94, 1.09, 1.58, 2.02, 2.43, 2.8, 3.32, 3.57, 3.85, 4.36]}, {"scene": "board", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The contract number links the audit to a board packet naming Trinity Consultants.", "t0": 23.43, "t1": 27.67, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "board", "kicker": "Bay Area Air Quality Management District", "text": "May 2025 board packet", "mark": "May 2025 board packet"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.61, 0.96, 1.25, 1.41, 1.71, 1.85, 1.93, 2.26, 2.67, 3.04, 3.49]}, {"scene": "board", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The distribution list included 120 vendors. One submitted qualifications.", "t0": 27.79, "t1": 33.39, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "One respondent"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.89, 1.16, 1.66, 1.91, 2.28, 2.71, 3.78, 4.14, 4.58]}, {"scene": "board", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Staff proposed a lifetime ceiling of 4,865,326 dollars.", "t0": 33.51, "t1": 38.43, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$4,865,326", "label": "Proposed lifetime contract ceiling"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.43, 0.97, 1.07, 1.63, 2.38, 2.58, 2.91, 3.28, 3.67, 4.03, 4.4]}, {"scene": "board", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "That amount was a proposed limit on spending.", "t0": 38.55, "t1": 40.93, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Contract ceiling"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.68, 0.85, 0.93, 1.43, 1.7, 1.84]}, {"scene": "follow", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The travel charges were later supported by documentation.", "t0": 41.15, "t1": 43.98, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit25", "kicker": "Bay Area Air Quality Management District / Federal Audit Clearinghouse", "text": "Travel documentation", "mark": "Travel documentation"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.49, 0.84, 1.03, 1.31, 1.79, 1.95]}, {"scene": "follow", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The next audit marked the recommendation implemented.", "t0": 44.1, "t1": 46.73, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit25", "kicker": "Bay Area Air Quality Management District / Federal Audit Clearinghouse", "text": "2025 follow-up", "mark": "2025 follow-up"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.49, 0.79, 1.1, 1.23, 1.97]}, {"scene": "follow", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "It did not say how much cash or credit the district received.", "t0": 46.85, "t1": 50.11, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Cash returned", "Credit date"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.29, 0.48, 0.83, 0.99, 1.22, 1.66, 1.83, 2.17, 2.28, 2.66]}, {"scene": "follow", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 50.23, "t1": 52.72, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.43, 0.87, 1.04, 1.32, 1.4, 1.5, 1.75, 2.03]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"rates": "Which rate was in the contract?", "board": "Following the contract number", "follow": "What the next audit settled"}, "look": "midnight", "hook": "question"}